#**
The discovery front page at the site root: what / shows when no site page or
weblog is the front door. FrontDoor forwards / to the site space's
page/discovery, and PageServlet serves this template for it whatever theme
the site space uses (a theme may still ship its own template named
discovery; none of the bundled themes does). One page, so the front door
looks the same on every install.

Design: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-03-front-page-redesign-design.md;
visual source of truth docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-03-front-page-redesign-mockup.html.

Data: $discovery.frontPage (DiscoveryModel). Entry titles are stored escaped
and emitted bare; weblog names come escaped from the wrapper; excerpts are
plain text and go through $utils.escapeHTML once; every href is escaped here.

The section classes (fd-discovery-headline, -popular, -latest, -blogs,
-different, -all) are stable markers the rendering tests and the browser
suite pin. Each sits alone in its class attribute and carries no style:
restyle through the inner classes, never by renaming a marker. No section
nests another section, because the tests read a marker up to its first
closing section tag.

The three house slots (data-slot a, b, c) are where ads will go once AdSense
is approved; until then each spotlights a blog the shelves do not show.

Velocity hazards (CLAUDE.md): the macros below take arguments, and no
comment names one with its hash, so nothing here is invoked by accident.
*#
## ------------------------------------------------------------ macros
## A post's picture: its featured image, else a tile in its blog's hue with
## the blog's initials. Hidden from assistive tech: the title link that
## follows is the accessible one. The picture still carries alt text (the image's own,
## else the post title): an empty alt is what search engines report as
## "image missing alt text". $fdEager is true for the lead story's
## picture only, the page's likely Largest Contentful Paint.
#macro(fdMedia $fdPost $fdSizes $fdEager=false)
#set($fdImg = false)
#set($fdImg = $fdPost.featuredImage)
#if($fdImg)
<a class="fd-media" href="$utils.escapeHTML($fdPost.permalink)" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">#showResponsiveImage($fdImg $utils.pictureAlt($fdImg, $fdPost.title) $fdSizes "" $fdEager)</a>
#else
<a class="fd-media fd-tile" href="$utils.escapeHTML($fdPost.permalink)" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">$discovery.initials($fdPost.website)</a>
#end
#end
## The blog a post comes from, in its hue.
#macro(fdKicker $fdPost)<a class="fd-kicker" href="$utils.escapeHTML($fdPost.website.absoluteURL)">$fdPost.website.name</a>#end
## Date and reading time. Absolute dates: the page is cached until the next
## discovery generation, so "2 hours ago" would go stale.
#macro(fdMeta $fdPost)<p class="fd-meta"><time datetime="$fdPost.formatPubTime('yyyy-MM-dd')">$fdPost.formatPubTime('MMM d')</time><span>$text.get("discovery.readingTime", [$fdPost.readingMinutes])</span></p>#end
## A post's plain-text excerpt, when it has one.
#macro(fdExcerpt $fdPost $fdClass)
#set($fdEx = false)
#set($fdEx = $fdPost.excerpt)
#if($fdEx)<p class="$fdClass">$utils.escapeHTML($fdEx)</p>#end
#end
## A blog's hue, 1 to 6, by its place in the all-blogs list.
#macro(fdHue $fdBlog)#set($fdB = $fdHandles.indexOf($fdBlog.handle) % 6 + 1)#end
## One house slot: a blog the shelves do not show.
#macro(fdSpot $fdBlog $fdSlot)
#fdHue($fdBlog)
<aside class="fd-slot fd-slot-$fdSlot" data-slot="$fdSlot" aria-label="$text.get('discovery.spotlight')">
    <div class="fd-spot" data-b="$fdB">
        <span class="fd-mark" aria-hidden="true">$discovery.initials($fdBlog)</span>
        <div class="fd-spot-text">
            <p class="fd-label">$text.get("discovery.spotlight")</p>
            <a class="fd-spot-name" href="$utils.escapeHTML($fdBlog.absoluteURL)">$fdBlog.name</a>
            #if($utils.isNotEmpty($fdBlog.tagline))<p class="fd-spot-about">$utils.escapeHTML($fdBlog.tagline)</p>#end
        </div>
        <a class="fd-spot-go" href="$utils.escapeHTML($fdBlog.absoluteURL)" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">$text.get("discovery.visit", [$fdBlog.name]) &#8594;</a>
    </div>
</aside>
#end
## The newsletter form: the site space's own list (Weblog Settings), built
## in the browser by the subscribe script in the showAudienceAssets macro.
#macro(fdSubscribe)<div class="subscribe-form-slot" data-list-uuid="$utils.escapeHTML($fdList)" data-endpoint="$utils.escapeHTML($url.site)/newsletter/subscribe"></div>#end
## ------------------------------------------------------------ data
#set($dFront = $discovery.frontPage)
## The lead story's picture is the page's share picture (og:image): handed
## to the showSeoHead macro in the head below. False when the lead has none.
#set($fdShare = false)
#if($dFront.headline)#set($fdShare = $dFront.headline.featuredImage)#end
#set($fdList = "")
#if($model.weblog.subscribeFormShown)#set($fdList = $model.weblog.newsletterListUuid)#end
#set($fdHandles = [])
#foreach($fdBlog in $dFront.allBlogs)#set($fdAdded = $fdHandles.add($fdBlog.handle))#end
## the house slots' blogs: those no shelf shows, else every blog
#set($fdShelved = [])
#foreach($dCard in $dFront.blogs)#set($fdAdded = $fdShelved.add($dCard.weblog.handle))#end
#set($fdSpots = [])
#foreach($fdBlog in $dFront.allBlogs)#if(!$fdShelved.contains($fdBlog.handle))#set($fdAdded = $fdSpots.add($fdBlog))#end#end
#if($fdSpots.isEmpty())#set($fdSpots = $dFront.allBlogs)#end
<!DOCTYPE html>
## lang: WeblogWrapper#getLanguageTag, as page.vm explains.
<html lang="$model.weblog.getLanguageTag()">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src * data:; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://player.vimeo.com; font-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; connect-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'">
    ## The site space's name is the site's, pre-escaped by WeblogWrapper#getName.
    <title>$model.weblog.name</title>
    <link href="$url.absoluteSite/favicon.svg" rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" />
    ## The site space has no posts, so no feed autodiscovery.
    #showSeoHead($fdShare)
    #showAnalyticsTrackingCode($model.weblog)
    #showAudienceAssets()
    <style>
#parse("templates/weblog/site-styles.vm")
.fd-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 12px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: var(--t-label);
    color: var(--ink-soft); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fd-meta > * + *::before { content: "\00b7"; margin-right: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft); opacity: .6; }
.fd-kicker { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; font-size: var(--t-label); font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hue, var(--accent)) !important; }
/* round, like the blog nav's dots: one marker for "this blog" everywhere */
.fd-kicker::before { content: ""; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 99px; background: currentColor; }
.fd-btn, .fd-front .newsletter-subscribe button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    height: 40px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 99px; border: 0; background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--on-accent) !important; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; }

/* blog nav */
.fd-sections { border-block: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
/* One row that scrolls sideways and shows it: the list fades at whichever
   end has more (the script sets data-more), a step button sits over each
   fade for a pointer, and the link to every blog is outside the list, so it
   never scrolls away. Without the script the row still scrolls and the link
   still says there is more. */
.fd-sections-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.fd-sections-scroll { position: relative; flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
.fd-sections ul { display: flex; gap: 4px; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; padding-block: 6px;
    scroll-padding-inline: 40px; overscroll-behavior-x: contain; }
.fd-sections ul::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.fd-sections ul[data-more~="on"] { -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to left, transparent, #000 56px);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to left, transparent, #000 56px); }
.fd-sections ul[data-more~="back"] { -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 56px);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 56px); }
.fd-sections ul[data-more~="back"][data-more~="on"] {
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 56px, #000 calc(100% - 56px), transparent);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 56px, #000 calc(100% - 56px), transparent); }
.fd-step { position: absolute; top: 50%; z-index: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px;
    margin-top: -14px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 99px; background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink); font: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; }
.fd-step[hidden] { display: none; }
.fd-step:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
.fd-step-back { left: 0; }
.fd-step-on { right: 0; }
/* a finger scrolls the row itself; the fades are cue enough */
@media (hover: none) { .fd-step { display: none; } }
body.fd-front a.fd-sections-all { flex: none; padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent);
    white-space: nowrap; }
.fd-sections a { display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 99px;
    white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fd-sections a:hover, .fd-sections a[aria-current] { background: var(--accent-quiet); color: var(--ink); }
.fd-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--hue, var(--accent)); }

/* media: the featured image cropped to its slot, or the blog's tile */
.fd-media { display: block; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; border-radius: var(--r); overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--line); max-width: 100%; }
.fd-media picture, .fd-media img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.fd-tile { display: grid; place-items: center; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92) !important;
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--t-site);
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--hue, var(--accent)), color-mix(in oklab, var(--hue, var(--accent)) 60%, #0b1414)); }

/* lead and the popular rail */
.fd-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 32px; padding-block: 32px; }
.fd-lead { display: grid; gap: 14px; align-content: start; }
.fd-lead .fd-media { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }
.fd-eyebrow { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 16px; align-items: center; }
.fd-lead-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--t-lead); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -.015em; text-wrap: balance; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.fd-dek { font-size: var(--t-read); color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 62ch; }
.fd-rail { display: grid; gap: 24px; align-content: start; }
.fd-rank { counter-reset: fd-rank; margin-top: 8px !important; }
.fd-rank li { counter-increment: fd-rank; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 4px 8px; padding-block: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.fd-rank li::before { content: counter(fd-rank); grid-row: span 2; font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: var(--t-head); color: var(--accent); line-height: 1.2; }
.fd-rank .fd-t { font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--t-read); line-height: 1.35; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.fd-card-signup { border-radius: var(--r); background: var(--accent-quiet); padding: 20px; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
.fd-card-signup h2, .fd-band h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; text-wrap: balance; }
.fd-card-signup h2 { font-size: var(--t-head); }
.fd-card-signup p, .fd-band p { color: var(--ink-soft); }

/* the newsletter form the subscribe script builds */
.fd-front .newsletter-subscribe { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-end; }
.fd-front .newsletter-subscribe label { flex: 1 1 12rem; margin: 0; font-size: var(--t-label); color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fd-front .newsletter-subscribe input[type=email] { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: none; height: 40px;
    margin-top: 4px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 99px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink); font: inherit; }
.fd-front .newsletter-subscribe button { margin: 0; }

/* house slots: a blog spotlight until the ad slot is filled */
.fd-slot { display: block; }
.fd-spot { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 8px 16px; align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: var(--r); border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--hue, var(--accent)); }
.fd-spot .fd-mark { width: 44px; height: 44px; font-size: var(--t-read); }
.fd-spot-name { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--t-head); font-weight: 600; }
.fd-spot-about { color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fd-spot-go { font-weight: 600; color: var(--hue, var(--accent)) !important; white-space: nowrap; }
.fd-slot-a { padding-block: 0 24px; }
.fd-slot-b .fd-spot { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); align-content: start; padding: 24px; }
.fd-slot-c { padding-block: 8px 24px; }

/* sections */
.fd-sec { padding-block: 32px; }
.fd-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
.fd-head h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--t-head); font-weight: 600; }
.fd-head a { font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); white-space: nowrap; }
.fd-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
.fd-latest li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 20px; padding-block: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.fd-latest li:first-child { padding-top: 4px; }
.fd-latest .fd-media { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
.fd-txt { display: grid; gap: 6px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; }
.fd-txt h3, .fd-diff h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--t-head); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25;
    text-wrap: balance; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.fd-ex { color: var(--ink-soft); display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden; }
.fd-side { display: grid; gap: 24px; align-content: start; }
.fd-side-in { position: sticky; top: 16px; display: grid; gap: 24px; }
.fd-browse li a { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 10px; align-items: center;
    padding-block: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.fd-browse .fd-n { font-weight: 600; }
.fd-count { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: var(--t-label); color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fd-browse-all { display: block; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--t-label); }
.fd-shelves { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
/* a column, so each card's "Visit" link sits on its bottom edge and the row lines up */
.fd-shelf { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 4px solid var(--hue, var(--accent)); border-radius: var(--r);
    background: var(--surface); padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.fd-shelf-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 4px 12px; align-items: center; }
.fd-shelf-head .fd-mark { width: 40px; height: 40px; font-size: var(--t-read); grid-row: span 2; }
.fd-shelf-name { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--t-head); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; }
.fd-shelf .fd-about { color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fd-shelf .fd-media { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }
.fd-shelf ol { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
.fd-shelf ol a { display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--t-read); line-height: 1.35; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.fd-visit { font-weight: 600; color: var(--hue, var(--accent)) !important; }
.fd-shelf .fd-visit { margin-top: auto; }
.fd-band { background: var(--accent-quiet); }
.fd-band .fd-wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px 48px;
    align-items: center; padding-block: 40px; }
.fd-band h2 { font-size: var(--t-site); }
.fd-band p { font-size: var(--t-read); margin-top: 8px; max-width: 48ch; }
.fd-diff { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.fd-diff li { display: grid; gap: 10px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; }
.fd-places .places-been-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.fd-places .places-been-list a { display: inline-flex; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 99px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); font-weight: 600; }
.fd-dir { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.fd-dir li { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 2px 12px; align-items: center;
    padding: 14px; border-radius: var(--r); border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
/* the whole tile is the blog's link, and lights up in its hue */
.fd-dir a::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit; }
.fd-dir li:hover, .fd-dir li:focus-within { border-color: var(--hue, var(--accent)); }
.fd-dir li:hover a { color: var(--hue, var(--accent)); }
.fd-dir .fd-mark { grid-row: span 2; width: 36px; height: 36px; }
.fd-dir a { font-weight: 600; }
/* the tagline says what the blog is about; two lines at most keep the tiles even */
.fd-dir p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: var(--t-label); display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }
.fd-empty { padding-block: 48px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

@media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .fd-top, .fd-body { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .fd-rail, .fd-side-in { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); position: static; }
    .fd-shelves, .fd-diff { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .fd-dir { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .fd-top { padding-top: 16px; gap: 24px; }
    .fd-lead .fd-media { margin-inline: calc(-1 * var(--gutter)); border-radius: 0; max-width: none; }
    .fd-rail, .fd-side-in, .fd-diff, .fd-dir, .fd-band .fd-wrap { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .fd-latest li { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 96px; gap: 14px; }
    .fd-latest li .fd-media { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; aspect-ratio: 1; font-size: var(--t-head); }
    .fd-latest li .fd-txt { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
    .fd-latest h3 { font-size: var(--t-read); }
    .fd-latest .fd-ex { display: none; }
    .fd-shelves { grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 85%; grid-template-columns: none; overflow-x: auto;
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; padding-bottom: 8px; }
    .fd-shelf { scroll-snap-align: start; }
    .fd-spot { grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .fd-spot-go { grid-column: 2; }
    /* slot B is one column: a link placed in a second one squeezed the first to nothing,
       and the mark sat on top of the words */
    .fd-slot-b .fd-spot-go { grid-column: 1; }
    .fd-band h2 { font-size: var(--t-head); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .fd-media img { transition: transform .4s ease; }
    .fd-media:hover img { transform: scale(1.015); }
    .fd-dir li { transition: border-color .15s ease; }
}
    </style>
</head>
<body class="fd-front">
<a class="fd-skip" href="#main">$text.get("discovery.skip")</a>

## the site's masthead (weblog.vm), shared with the site's search page
#set($fdNewsletter = $fdList != "")
#showSiteMasthead($model.weblog "" $fdNewsletter)

#if(!$dFront.allBlogs.isEmpty())
<nav class="fd-sections" aria-label="$text.get('discovery.blogsNav')">
    <div class="fd-wrap fd-sections-row">
        <div class="fd-sections-scroll">
            <button type="button" class="fd-step fd-step-back" hidden aria-label="$text.get('discovery.blogsNav.back')">&#8249;</button>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="$url.home" aria-current="page">$text.get("discovery.frontPage")</a></li>
                #foreach($fdBlog in $dFront.allBlogs)
                #fdHue($fdBlog)
                <li><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($fdBlog.absoluteURL)" data-b="$fdB"><span class="fd-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>$fdBlog.name</a></li>
                #end
            </ul>
            <button type="button" class="fd-step fd-step-on" hidden aria-label="$text.get('discovery.blogsNav.on')">&#8250;</button>
        </div>
        ## outside the list: it stays put while the row scrolls
        <a class="fd-sections-all" href="#fd-all-label">$text.get("discovery.allBlogsLink", [$dFront.allBlogs.size()])</a>
    </div>
</nav>
## The row's ends: which way there is more, and the two buttons that step
## that way. No dollar sign and no hash in the script: Velocity would read
## either.
<script data-fd-row>
(function () {
    var row = document.querySelector('.fd-sections-scroll');
    if (!row) {
        return;
    }
    var list = row.querySelector('ul');
    var back = row.querySelector('.fd-step-back');
    var on = row.querySelector('.fd-step-on');
    function sync() {
        var most = list.scrollWidth - list.clientWidth;
        var at = Math.abs(list.scrollLeft);
        var more = [];
        if (at > 4) {
            more.push('back');
        }
        if (at < most - 4) {
            more.push('on');
        }
        list.setAttribute('data-more', more.join(' '));
        back.hidden = more.indexOf('back') < 0;
        on.hidden = more.indexOf('on') < 0;
    }
    function step(way) {
        var rtl = getComputedStyle(list).direction === 'rtl';
        list.scrollBy({ left: (rtl ? -way : way) * Math.max(160, list.clientWidth * 0.75), behavior: 'smooth' });
    }
    back.addEventListener('click', function () { step(-1); });
    on.addEventListener('click', function () { step(1); });
    list.addEventListener('scroll', sync, { passive: true });
    window.addEventListener('resize', sync);
    window.addEventListener('load', sync);
    sync();
})();
</script>
#end

<main id="main">
#if($dFront.allBlogs.isEmpty())
    <p class="fd-wrap fd-empty">$text.get("siteDirectory.empty")</p>
#else
<div class="fd-wrap">
    <div class="fd-top">
#if($dFront.headline)
#set($dLead = $dFront.headline)
#fdHue($dLead.website)
        <section class="fd-discovery-headline" aria-labelledby="fd-headline-label">
            <article class="fd-discovery-post fd-lead" data-b="$fdB">
                #fdMedia($dLead "(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 66vw" true)
                <div class="fd-eyebrow">
                    ## "most read" only when it was ranked by traffic; otherwise it is the newest post
                    <h2 class="fd-label" id="fd-headline-label">#if($dFront.headlineRanked)$text.get("discovery.headline")#else$text.get("discovery.headline.newest")#end</h2>
                    #fdKicker($dLead)
                </div>
                <h3 class="fd-lead-title"><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($dLead.permalink)">$dLead.title</a></h3>
                #fdExcerpt($dLead "fd-dek")
                #fdMeta($dLead)
            </article>
        </section>
#end
        <div class="fd-rail">
#if(!$dFront.popular.isEmpty())
            <section class="fd-discovery-popular" aria-labelledby="fd-popular-label">
                <h2 class="fd-label" id="fd-popular-label">$text.get("discovery.popular")</h2>
                <ol class="fd-rank">
                #foreach($dPost in $dFront.popular)
                #fdHue($dPost.website)
                    <li class="fd-discovery-post" data-b="$fdB"><a class="fd-t" href="$utils.escapeHTML($dPost.permalink)">$dPost.title</a>#fdKicker($dPost)</li>
                #end
                </ol>
            </section>
#end
#if($fdList != "")
            <div class="fd-card-signup">
                <h2>$text.get("discovery.newsletter.card")</h2>
                <p>$text.get("discovery.newsletter.text")</p>
                #fdSubscribe()
            </div>
#end
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="fd-wrap">#fdSpot($fdSpots.get(0) "a")</div>

<div class="fd-wrap">
    <div class="fd-body">
#if(!$dFront.latest.isEmpty())
        <section class="fd-discovery-latest" aria-labelledby="fd-latest-label">
            <div class="fd-head"><h2 id="fd-latest-label">$text.get("discovery.latest")</h2></div>
            <ul class="fd-latest">
            #foreach($dPost in $dFront.latest)
            #fdHue($dPost.website)
                <li class="fd-discovery-post" data-b="$fdB">
                    #fdMedia($dPost "(max-width: 640px) 96px, 220px")
                    <div class="fd-txt">
                        #fdKicker($dPost)
                        <h3><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($dPost.permalink)">$dPost.title</a></h3>
                        #fdExcerpt($dPost "fd-ex")
                        #fdMeta($dPost)
                    </div>
                </li>
            #end
            </ul>
        </section>
#else
        <div></div>
#end
        <div class="fd-side">
            <div class="fd-side-in">
                #set($fdSpotB = $fdSpots.size())
                #fdSpot($fdSpots.get(1 % $fdSpotB) "b")
                ## at most five, newest post first, so the sticky sidebar stays
                ## shorter than the screen; All blogs below is the full list
                #if(!$dFront.activeBlogs.isEmpty())
                <nav class="fd-browse" aria-labelledby="fd-browse-label">
                    <h2 class="fd-label" id="fd-browse-label">$text.get("discovery.activeBlogs")</h2>
                    <ul>
                    #foreach($fdBlog in $dFront.activeBlogs)
                    #fdHue($fdBlog)
                        <li data-b="$fdB"><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($fdBlog.absoluteURL)"><span class="fd-mark" aria-hidden="true">$discovery.initials($fdBlog)</span><span class="fd-n">$fdBlog.name</span><span class="fd-count">$discovery.postCount($fdBlog)</span></a></li>
                    #end
                    </ul>
                    #if($dFront.allBlogs.size() > $dFront.activeBlogs.size())
                    <a class="fd-browse-all" href="#fd-all-label">$text.get("discovery.allBlogsLink", [$dFront.allBlogs.size()]) &#8595;</a>
                    #end
                </nav>
                #end
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

#if(!$dFront.blogs.isEmpty())
<div class="fd-wrap">
    <section class="fd-discovery-blogs" aria-labelledby="fd-blogs-label">
        <div class="fd-sec">
            <div class="fd-head"><h2 id="fd-blogs-label">$text.get("discovery.blogs")</h2></div>
            <div class="fd-shelves">
            #foreach($dCard in $dFront.blogs)
            #fdHue($dCard.weblog)
                <article class="fd-discovery-card fd-shelf" data-b="$fdB">
                    <div class="fd-shelf-head">
                        <span class="fd-mark" aria-hidden="true">$discovery.initials($dCard.weblog)</span>
                        <h3 class="fd-shelf-name"><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($dCard.weblog.absoluteURL)">$dCard.weblog.name</a></h3>
                        <span class="fd-count">$text.get("discovery.posts", [$discovery.postCount($dCard.weblog)])</span>
                    </div>
                    #if($utils.isNotEmpty($dCard.weblog.tagline))<p class="fd-about">$utils.escapeHTML($dCard.weblog.tagline)</p>#end
                    #if(!$dCard.topEntries.isEmpty())#fdMedia($dCard.topEntries.get(0) "(max-width: 640px) 85vw, 33vw")#end
                    <ol>
                    #foreach($dPost in $dCard.topEntries)
                        <li><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($dPost.permalink)">$dPost.title</a></li>
                    #end
                    </ol>
                    <a class="fd-visit" href="$utils.escapeHTML($dCard.weblog.absoluteURL)" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">$text.get("discovery.visit", [$dCard.weblog.name]) &#8594;</a>
                </article>
            #end
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
#end

#if($fdList != "")
<div class="fd-band" id="fd-newsletter">
    <div class="fd-wrap">
        <div>
            <h2>$text.get("discovery.newsletter.title")</h2>
            <p>$text.get("discovery.newsletter.text")</p>
        </div>
        #fdSubscribe()
    </div>
</div>
#end

<div class="fd-wrap">
#if(!$dFront.different.isEmpty())
    <section class="fd-discovery-different" aria-labelledby="fd-different-label">
        <div class="fd-sec">
            <div class="fd-head"><h2 id="fd-different-label">$text.get("discovery.different")</h2></div>
            <ul class="fd-diff">
            #foreach($dPost in $dFront.different)
            #fdHue($dPost.website)
                <li class="fd-discovery-post" data-b="$fdB">
                    #fdMedia($dPost "(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 33vw")
                    #fdKicker($dPost)
                    <h3><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($dPost.permalink)">$dPost.title</a></h3>
                    #fdExcerpt($dPost "fd-ex")
                </li>
            #end
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>
#end

    #fdSpot($fdSpots.get(2 % $fdSpotB) "c")

    ## Places you've been: the reader's own recent blogs, from their browser's
    ## storage only. Hidden and empty until the showPlacesYouveBeen macro
    ## (called by the colophon) fills it; with no storage or no JavaScript
    ## nothing ever shows.
    <div class="fd-sec fd-places">
        <nav class="places-been" hidden data-places aria-labelledby="fd-places-label">
            <div class="fd-head"><h2 id="fd-places-label">$text.get("discovery.placesBeen")</h2></div>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <section class="fd-discovery-all" aria-labelledby="fd-all-label">
        <div class="fd-sec">
            <div class="fd-head"><h2 id="fd-all-label">$text.get("discovery.allBlogs")</h2></div>
            <ul class="fd-dir">
            #foreach($fdBlog in $dFront.allBlogs)
            #fdHue($fdBlog)
                <li data-b="$fdB"><span class="fd-mark" aria-hidden="true">$discovery.initials($fdBlog)</span><a href="$utils.escapeHTML($fdBlog.absoluteURL)">$fdBlog.name</a><p>#if($utils.isNotEmpty($fdBlog.tagline))$utils.escapeHTML($fdBlog.tagline)#else$text.get("discovery.posts", [$discovery.postCount($fdBlog)])#end</p></li>
            #end
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
#end
</main>

## the site's footer (weblog.vm), shared with the site's search page
#showSiteFooter($model.weblog)
</body>
</html>
